  "description": "Use this skill for any query mentioning Koinju (koinju.io, api.koinju.io, docs.koinju.io, mcp koinju) — getting credentials, connecting, querying, integrating, or optimizing the Koinju API. Also use when the user wants crypto market data without naming Koinju: historical OHLCV/candles, tick trades, funding rates, option chains, implied volatility, vol smile, IV surface, DVOL — across 13 exchanges, among them Binance, Bybit, OKX, Deribit, Coinbase and Kraken. Covers backtesting strategies on crypto price history, quant research, and enriching existing ClickHouse/Postgres/Redis stores with crypto data. Do NOT use for stock/equity markets or for general ClickHouse architecture questions unrelated to Koinju.",
